[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":202},["ShallowReactive",2],{"gql:data:tSinuZe0-8CcydL7CvGora3TzLS_-_Mju8WnP7ki0ac":3},{"teamMember":4},{"abbreviatedTitle":5,"bio":6,"image":7,"highlightStatement":9,"companies":18,"derivedSeoDescription":19,"derivedSeoTitle":20,"derivedSocialMediaDescription":19,"derivedSocialMediaImage":10,"derivedSocialMediaTitle":20,"emailAddress":21,"firstName":22,"focusAreas":23,"fullName":20,"fullTitle":5,"introduction":9,"lastName":24,"linkedinProfileUrl":25,"substackProfileUrl":9,"slug":26,"teamHighlights":27,"testimonials":37,"contentPosts":38,"twitterProfielUrl":9},"Operating Partner & CISO","My career began at the birth of the consumer internet. I worked on Microsoft’s IE4 browser team in the mid-’90s, followed by chapters at Yahoo!, NerdWallet, and Atlassian. I’ve been fortunate to sit at the center of several technological revolutions—early internet, mobile, and cloud. A technologist at heart, I’ve become a security enthusiast over time.\r\n\r\nI first crossed paths with IVP while serving as CISO and VP of Engineering at NerdWallet. What struck me then is what still defines the firm today: a culture that is collaborative, low-ego, and truly committed to founders. IVP has a 45-year track record of backing breakthrough innovation, recognizing exceptional entrepreneurs early and supporting them as they take on the hardest problems in technology.\r\n\r\nNow, as Operating Partner and CISO at IVP, I put my experience as an Engineering and Security leader to work for founders. I’ve spent time at public companies and at startups of various stages. I can roll up my sleeves to build with you, brainstorm with you, and bring the perspective of a buyer to help shape and position your product. More than anything, I am the kind of partner that builds truly innovative products—hands-on, technical, and committed to building alongside you.\r\n",{"id":8,"alt":9,"caption":10,"assetUrl":11,"assetUrlXs":12,"assetUrlSm":13,"assetUrlMd":14,"assetUrlLg":15,"assetUrlXl":16,"assetUrlXxl":17},"2342","",null,"https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2342/IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Bala.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2342/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Bala.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2342/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Bala.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2342/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Bala.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2342/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Bala.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2342/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Bala.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2342/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Bala.jpg",[],"IVP CISO Leads Cybersecurity Investments","Bala Sathiamurthy","bsathiamurthy@ivp.com","Bala","Infra, Cybersecurity, SaaS","Sathiamurthy","https://www.linkedin.com/in/balasathiamurthy/","bala-sathiamurthy",[28,31,34],{"header":29,"body":30},"What Accomplishments and Awards Are You Most Proud of in Work or Life?","I’m one of the few to receive the Super Paranoid award at Yahoo. And I have the animated superhero character, “Captain Bandwidth,” to prove it.",{"header":32,"body":33},"What Is One Ingredient You Put in Everything?","Ketchup",{"header":35,"body":36},"What Does Your Ideal Day Consist Of?","Spending time with people who give me energy. At 7am, it’s my daughter. ",[],[39,90,141],{"id":40,"date":41,"company":42,"companies":74,"contentCategory":75,"externalLinkUrl":9,"linkType":79,"pdfLinkFile":80,"hideDate":81,"hasDetailPage":10,"slug":82,"tileImage":83,"altHoverImage":85,"landscapeHero":87,"title":89},"229","2026-05-11",{"name":43,"slug":44,"headline":45,"logo":46,"colorFill":55,"logoBackground":56,"transparentLogo":65},"Cowboy Space Corporation","cowboy-space-corporation","Orbital infrastructure for the AI era",{"id":47,"alt":9,"caption":10,"assetUrl":48,"assetUrlXs":49,"assetUrlSm":50,"assetUrlMd":51,"assetUrlLg":52,"assetUrlXl":53,"assetUrlXxl":54},"2767","h